# Build artifacts
**/target/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/release/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/

# Local verification dumps stay untracked. Tracked files under testing/ still
# clone: fig-tools-public and the design oracles restored for kernel tests and
# design-client tsc. Do not drop this rule to publish local dumps.
/testing/
.zcode/
.grok-bot-shots/
*.mac-local.*
/evidence/
/futureoxdesgin/
/frontend/design-client/verification/

# Generated kernel outputs (rebuilt via design-client `build:kernel`)
/frontend/design-client/public/kernel/
/frontend/design-client/src/generated/

# Python
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc

# Runtime
**/*.log
**/*.pid
.DS_Store

